# Conformance probe pack for `element` (spec 0.18) on a strict prefix of a
# group's path: `element body` and the group `body/item`. Public. No kinds.
# Ruling 12: the container is written even when the list is absent, where
# ruling 20 of 0.7 alone writes nothing for an absent or empty list.
format  conformance-cond-element-group
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    xml
root    msg
field   uid  @id  string
element body
group   probe.items  body/item
  field probe.label  @name  string
end
field   callsign  tail/@cs  string
